and a man can think of how politics then was about&nbsp;
the same as now just as much Shenanigans as ever

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:09.000
I was six years old in October of 1884 when&nbsp;
my father took me downtown to see a republican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:16.680
torchlight procession this is in Galesburg yes&nbsp;
hundreds of Republicans each one with a lighted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:28.740
